      "data": {
        "text": "\"Task specifications (listed alphabetically; implement only the requested file):\ncollect_platform_metadata.py - returns model output together with provider platform metadata such as usage, resource IDs, or model handles\ninvoke_platform_model.py - invokes a provider-managed model through a project-, deployment-, or inference-profile-scoped platform client\nlocalized_platform_output.py - Translate platform model output for another locale\nmodel_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Managed Model Platform Workflow\nmodel_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for Managed Model Platform Workflow\nplatform_brief_audio.py - Generate spoken briefings from platform outputs\nplatform_output_embedding.py - Embed platform outputs for evaluation or retrieval\nplatform_output_safety.py - Check platform model output for unsafe content\nselect_platform_resource.py - resolves a provider-specific model, deployment, or inference resource before invocation\nstream_platform_generation.py - streams output from a managed model platform while preserving provider response objects\n\nCreate invoke_platform_model.py in the current working directory.\nTask: invokes a provider-managed model through a project-, deployment-, or inference-profile-scoped platform client.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
